{"id":"1c09889422d33e53","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-forcing.md","title":"Forcing Method","display":"df-forcing — Forcing Method","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-forcing","aliases":["92-df-forcing"],"display":"df-forcing — Forcing Method","depends_on":["[[92-df-zfc]]","[[92-df-first-order-language]]","[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]","[[92-df-ordinal]]"],"source":"原书之外的集合论 forcing 背景；本地 CTM 语义版本","source_status":"外部背景定义；不宣称已重建 Forcing Theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-forcing — Forcing Method"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66c9470f107a6bad\" href=\"?note=66c9470f107a6bad\" title=\"92-df-zfc\">92-df-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b146f0add46bd47\" href=\"?note=0b146f0add46bd47\" title=\"92-df-language-indexed-semantics\">92-df-language-indexed-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"afb378126cbf5f83\" href=\"?note=afb378126cbf5f83\" title=\"92-df-ordinal\">92-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的集合论 forcing 背景；本地 CTM 语义版本"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部背景定义；不宣称已重建 Forcing Theorem"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是外部可数的传递集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\in)\\models_\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\">\\((M,\\in)\\models_\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P=(P,\\le_{\\mathbb P})\\in M\">\\(\\mathbb P=(P,\\le_{\\mathbb P})\\in M\\)</span> 是非空偏序或预序，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\le_{\\mathbb P}q\">\\(p\\le_{\\mathbb P}q\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 比 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 强；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq P\">\\(G\\subseteq P\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_\\in(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_{r-1}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_\\in(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_{r-1}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_\\alpha,\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M,\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G,\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M,M[G],\\Vdash^{\\mathbb P}_M\">\\(N_\\alpha,\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M,\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G,\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M,M[G],\\Vdash^{\\mathbb P}_M\\)</span> 为定义目标。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 是元理论的序数类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M\\)</span> 为 M 中序数的集合。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的序数上递归，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P^M(X)\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(X)\\cap M\">\\(\\mathcal P^M(X)\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(X)\\cap M\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nN_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,&amp;N_{\\alpha+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal P^M(N_\\alpha\\times P),&amp;N_\\lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}N_\\alpha\\quad(\\lambda\\text{为非零极限}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M}N_\\alpha,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\sigma):\\exists p\\in G\\;((\\sigma,p)\\in\\tau)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nN_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,&amp;N_{\\alpha+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal P^M(N_\\alpha\\times P),&amp;N_\\lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}N_\\alpha\\quad(\\lambda\\text{为非零极限}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M}N_\\alpha,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\sigma):\\exists p\\in G\\;((\\sigma,p)\\in\\tau)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M(G)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq P\\land\n\\forall p\\in G\\forall q\\in P(p\\le_{\\mathbb P}q\\to q\\in G)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p,q\\in G\\exists r\\in G(r\\le_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\le_{\\mathbb P}q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;[(D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\le_{\\mathbb P}p))\\to D\\cap G\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\nM[G]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\tau):\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\np\\Vdash^{\\mathbb P}_M\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall G\\subseteq P\\;[\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M(G)\\land p\\in G\\Longrightarrow\n(M[G],\\in)\\models_\\in\\varphi[(\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\tau_i))_{i&lt;r}/(v_i)_{i&lt;r}]],\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M(G)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq P\\land\n\\forall p\\in G\\forall q\\in P(p\\le_{\\mathbb P}q\\to q\\in G)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p,q\\in G\\exists r\\in G(r\\le_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\le_{\\mathbb P}q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;[(D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\le_{\\mathbb P}p))\\to D\\cap G\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\nM[G]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\tau):\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\np\\Vdash^{\\mathbb P}_M\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall G\\subseteq P\\;[\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M(G)\\land p\\in G\\Longrightarrow\n(M[G],\\in)\\models_\\in\\varphi[(\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\tau_i))_{i&lt;r}/(v_i)_{i&lt;r}]],\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>最后一行的参数要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in P\">\\(p\\in P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\tau\\in(\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M)^r\">\\(\\vec\\tau\\in(\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M)^r\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>名字由秩递归得到；名字中的子名字具有更低集合秩，故 valuation 唯一存在。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M\\subseteq M\">\\(\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M\\subseteq M\\)</span>，其 valuation 像为集合。空名字属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_1\">\\(N_1\\)</span>，取值为空集，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span> 非空，能使用一般成员语言语义。\n外部可数性使 M 中稠密集可以枚举。给定任意 p，从 p 开始依次选更强条件落入各稠密集，取该链的向上闭包得到含 p 的 M-generic 滤子；因此语义定义并非因没有泛型滤子而真空成立。\n上式是外部语义 forcing；没有把它宣称为已经完成的 M 内可定义关系。秩递归的句法 forcing 与它的等价及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\">\\(M[G]\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\)</span> 仍依赖 Forcing Theorem 的外部证明。CTM 假设严格强于单说 ZFC 相容，不据此无条件推出相对相容性。\n这是原书之外的背景；CH 独立性的相对相容性记录见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fef4cc51fd3a44b5\" href=\"?note=fef4cc51fd3a44b5\" title=\"92-thm-ch-independence\">92-thm-ch-independence</a>，该导航链接不是本定义的数学依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"66c9470f107a6bad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-language-indexed-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"0b146f0add46bd47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"afb378126cbf5f83","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-ch-independence","status":"resolved","id":"fef4cc51fd3a44b5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"名字由秩递归得到；名字中的子名字具有更低集合秩，故 valuation 唯一存在。$\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M\\subseteq M$，其 valuation 像为集合。空名字属于 $N_1$，取值为空集，故 $M[G]$ 非空，能使用一般成员语言语义。\n外部可数性使 M 中稠密集可以枚举。给定任意 p，从 p 开始依次选更强条件落入各稠密集，取该链的向上闭包得到含 p 的 M-generic 滤子；因此语义定义并非因没有泛型滤子而真空成立。\n上式是外部语义 forcing；没有把它宣称为已经完成的 M 内可定义关系。秩递归的句法 forcing 与它的等价及 $M[G]\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}$ 仍依赖 Forcing Theorem 的外部证明。CTM 假设严格强于单说 ZFC 相容，不据此无条件推出相对相容性。\n这是原书之外的背景；CH 独立性的相对相容性记录见[[92-thm-ch-independence]]，该导航链接不是本定义的数学依赖。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"(M,\\in)\\models_\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P=(P,\\le_{\\mathbb P})\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"p\\le_{\\mathbb P}q","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_\\in(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_{r-1}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N_\\alpha,\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M,\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G,\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M,M[G],\\Vdash^{\\mathbb P}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P^M(X)\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(X)\\cap M","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nN_0&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,&N_{\\alpha+1}&\\coloneqq\\mathcal P^M(N_\\alpha\\times P),&N_\\lambda&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha<\\lambda}N_\\alpha\\quad(\\lambda\\text{为非零极限}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M}N_\\alpha,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\tau)&\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\sigma):\\exists p\\in G\\;((\\sigma,p)\\in\\tau)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M(G)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq P\\land\n\\forall p\\in G\\forall q\\in P(p\\le_{\\mathbb P}q\\to q\\in G)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p,q\\in G\\exists r\\in G(r\\le_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\le_{\\mathbb P}q)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;[(D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\le_{\\mathbb P}p))\\to D\\cap G\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\nM[G]&\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\tau):\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\np\\Vdash^{\\mathbb P}_M\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\forall G\\subseteq P\\;[\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M(G)\\land p\\in G\\Longrightarrow\n(M[G],\\in)\\models_\\in\\varphi[(\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\tau_i))_{i<r}/(v_i)_{i<r}]],\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\tau\\in(\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M)^r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M\\subseteq M","display":false},{"tex":"N_1","display":false},{"tex":"M[G]","display":false},{"tex":"M[G]\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}","display":false}],"bytes":3407,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]] → [[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]] → [[92-df-first-order-derivation]]供语言扩张与成员语言使用。非标准模型见[[92-ex-nonstandard-model]]；集合论背景见[[92-df-zfc]]、[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]、[[92-df-constructible-universe]]、[[92-df-forcing]]与[[92-thm-ch-independence]]。这些背景不冒充原书的算术语法或定理证明。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-forcing]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-forcing]]"}],"outgoing":["66c9470f107a6bad","b230b875687723ed","0b146f0add46bd47","afb378126cbf5f83","fef4cc51fd3a44b5"]}